Vintage-style illustration of a proud orange fox sitting regally on an ornate throne, wearing a small lotus flower crown. The fox holds an antique brass menu button like a royal scepter. Behind the throne, faded blueprints and aged technical drawings are pinned to a cork board, showing UI mockups and interface sketches from different eras. The scene has warm sepia tones with subtle orange and purple accents, weathered paper textures, and soft vignette edges reminiscent of early 20th century advertising posters. The fox has a knowing, slightly smug expression, as if aware it has borrowed something valuable from those who came before.
